Description:
    Create the migration for pgnats' foreign server, which holds its entire
    configuration. pgnats allows exactly one per database.

Examples:
    rails generate active_record_pgnats:server nats

        create: db/migrate/[TIMESTAMP]_create_nats_server_nats.rb

    rails generate active_record_pgnats:server nats --host=10.0.0.1 --port=4223
